*.sh text eol=lf

# Never let end-of-line conversion rewrite a PDF: core.autocrlf on Windows
# inflates the committed bytes, and the PDF text-layer tests compare fixture
# sizes and parse content streams that corruption invalidates.
*.pdf binary

# Same reason for the poster image fixture: end-of-line conversion would corrupt
# the bytes, and the OCR replay test compares what is uploaded against the file
# as committed.
*.png binary
